\p
\v 15 \wj “\+w Si|strong="G1437"\+w* \+w tu|strong="G4771"\+w* hermano peca \+w contra|strong="G1519"\+w* ti, \+w ve|strong="G5217"\+w* \+w y|strong="G2532"\+w* hazle ver \+w su|strong="G3588"\+w* falta \+w a|strong="G1519"\+w* solas. \+w Si|strong="G1437"\+w* \+w te|strong="G4771"\+w* escucha, habrás recuperado \+w a|strong="G1519"\+w* \+w tu|strong="G4771"\+w* hermano.\wj*  
